The elastic center deflection at fracture is
\[
\delta=\frac{FL^3}{4Ebd^3}
=\frac{(421.875)(5)^3}{4(18\times10^6)(0.5)(0.375)^3}
\approx 0.0278\ \text{in.}
\]

